# Native java_test around the Kotlin sources, not kt_jvm_test: the fixture's runfiles
# path arrives through `env` via $(rlocationpath), whose leading repo segment is `_main`
# when this module is the build root and the module's canonical name when consumed — only
# the build can spell it. Location expansion in `env` is documented core-Bazel behavior;
# kt_jvm_test passes env values through unexpanded, and a consumer builds these tests
# under whatever rules_kotlin version its own build resolves, so only documented core
# behavior is safe to lean on here.
java_test(
    name = "lead_scenario_test",
